└── given valid parameters
    ├── when initializer caller differs from configured owner
    │   └── it should initialize successfully and assign ownership only to configured owner
    ├── when max LTV is zero foreclosure LTV is MATH_PRECISION opening fee is MATH_PRECISION and credit limit is uint128 max
    │   └── it should accept every inclusive boundary
    ├── when convexPoolId is zero and all reported pool metadata matches
    │   └── it should accept pool ID zero
    ├── when ignored pool stash address is zero
    │   └── it should initialize successfully
    ├── when borrow token equals collateral token
    │   └── it should initialize successfully
    ├── when liquidation engine is nonzero and accepts registration
    │   └── it should store the engine and register the market
    ├── when liquidation engine rejects market registration
    │   └── it should propagate the failure and leave the proxy and IRM uninitialized
    ├── it should set MARKET_TYPE to CREDIT_MINT
    ├── it should initialize Base token oracle IRM LTV fee recipient and owner state
    ├── it should leave liquidationEngine at zero
    ├── it should register the market with the configured IRM exactly once
    ├── it should accept AdaptiveCurveIrm and PegResponsiveExponentialIrm implementations
    ├── it should grant only the configured emergency admin PAUSE_TYPE and FROZEN_TYPE pauser permissions
    ├── it should set creditAccount foreclosureLtv and borrowOpeningFee
    ├── it should set totalSupply assets to the credit limit and shares to zero
    ├── it should leave totalBorrowed and the credit account position empty
    ├── it should leave claimableFeesAssets at zero
    ├── it should leave badDebtAssets at zero
    ├── it should store the validated Convex configuration and mark it active
    ├── it should preserve initial reward token order and membership
    ├── it should emit SetCreditAccount from zero to the initial credit account
    ├── it should emit exactly one RewardTokenAdded for each initial reward token in list order
    ├── it should allow exactly MAX_REWARD_TOKENS including the primary reward token
    ├── it should leave the Booster collateral allowance at zero
    ├── it should leave idle and staked collateral at zero without calling Booster deposit
    ├── it should emit Base Credit and Convex configuration events in initialization order
    └── it should initialize authorization reentrancy ownership and UUPS state
